        startIndex: 0,
        endIndex: 13,
        summary: "讲者讲述几年前的一个雪夜：蒙特利尔零下 40 度，他半夜回到家却发现没带钥匙，钥匙就躺在餐桌上。他试遍所有门窗都锁死，又不能回 Jeff 家过夜（第二天一早要飞欧洲），只能又冷又急。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "broke into my own house", synonyms: ["broke into my house", "broke into my home"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "minus 40 degrees", synonyms: ["forty below zero", "minus forty"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "fumbling in my pockets", synonyms: ["fumbling for my keys", "searching my pockets"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "calling a locksmith", synonyms: ["call a locksmith", "get a locksmith"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 68.9,
        end: 97.24,
        startIndex: 14,
        endIndex: 19,
        summary: "他砸开地下室的窗户，清掉玻璃碎片钻了进去，用硬纸板糊住破口，打算早上去机场的路上再叫包工头来修。这笔钱花得不小，但大概不会比半夜叫开锁匠更贵，所以他觉得也算扯平了。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "cleared out the shards of glass", synonyms: ["removed the glass shards", "swept away the broken glass"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a piece of cardboard", synonyms: ["some cardboard", "a bit of cardboard"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "call my contractor", synonyms: ["phone my contractor", "reach my contractor"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "coming out even", synonyms: ["breaking even", "ending up even"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 97.44,
        end: 158.92,
        startIndex: 20,
        endIndex: 32,
        summary: "作为神经科学家，他知道大脑在压力下会释放皮质醇，加快心率、调节肾上腺素，并让思维变得混沌。第二天他因睡眠不足又惦记各种事，思维混沌却不自知，直到到了机场才发现没带护照，只能在厕所旁熬过八小时飞行。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "releases cortisol", synonyms: ["releases cortisol", "cortisol release"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "clouds your thinking", synonyms: ["fogs your thinking", "clouds the mind"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I didn't know it was cloudy", synonyms: ["didn't realize it was clouded", "unaware it was foggy"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I didn't have my passport", synonyms: ["I had forgotten my passport", "my passport was missing"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 159.23,
        end: 208.56,
        startIndex: 33,
        endIndex: 42,
        summary: "在那八小时里他开始思考：有没有什么办法、什么机制能提前防止坏事发生，或至少降低它变成彻底灾难的可能。一个月后，他与诺贝尔奖得主丹尼尔·卡尼曼吃饭，得知对方一直在实践「前瞻性后见之明」，也就是心理学家加里·克莱因提出的「事前验尸」。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "systems that I can put into place", synonyms: ["systems to put in place", "mechanisms to set up"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "prospective hindsight", synonyms: ["prospective hindsight", "hindsight in advance"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "pre-mortem", synonyms: ["premortem", "pre-mortem"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "total catastrophe", synonyms: ["complete disaster", "total disaster"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 208.72,
        end: 235.44,
        startIndex: 43,
        endIndex: 49,
        summary: "「事后复盘」是灾难发生后让专家查明哪里出错；而「事前验尸」是往前看，提前想清所有可能出错的地方，再想办法阻止或把损失降到最低。今天他想分享的，正是能用「事前验尸」来做的那些事。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "post-mortem", synonyms: ["postmortem", "after-action review"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "figure out what went wrong", synonyms: ["determine what went wrong", "identify the mistakes"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "look ahead", synonyms: ["look forward", "anticipate"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "minimize the damage", synonyms: ["reduce the damage", "limit the damage"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 235.66,
        end: 324.72,
        startIndex: 50,
        endIndex: 70,
        summary: "一些事很明显：在家里给容易丢的东西固定位置。这有科学依据——大脑的海马体历经数万年演化，专门记住重要事物的位置，让松鼠能找回自己埋的坚果。但它只擅长不移动的东西，所以我们才会总丢车钥匙、老花镜和护照。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "designate a place for things that are easily lost", synonyms: ["assign a fixed spot", "fixed place for things"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "spatial memory", synonyms: ["spatial memory", "memory for locations"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "hippocampus", synonyms: ["hippocampus", "the brain's locator"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "designate a spot for your keys", synonyms: ["a hook by the door", "a fixed spot for keys"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 325.0,
        end: 356.08,
        startIndex: 71,
        endIndex: 79,
        summary: "出行时，把信用卡、驾照、护照拍照发给自己存到云端，丢了或被偷也方便补办。要记住，压力下大脑会释放皮质醇，而皮质醇有毒、会让思维变浑，所以「事前验尸」的一部分就是承认压力下你不会处于最佳状态，并提前建好机制。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "What about travel?", synonyms: ["And travel?", "What about trips?"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Take a cell phone picture of your credit cards", synonyms: ["photograph your cards", "snap a picture of your cards"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "in the cloud", synonyms: ["in the cloud", "online"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Cortisol is toxic", synonyms: ["cortisol is poisonous", "cortisol harms"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 356.26,
        end: 391.7,
        startIndex: 80,
        endIndex: 89,
        summary: "最有压力的情形之一，是要做医疗决定。总有一天，我们都得为自己或挚爱之人未来的医疗方案做重大决定。他接下来要讲的这种医疗状况，可以代表各种医疗、财务、社交决策——凡是需要理性评估事实的决策都适用。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "confronted with a medical", synonyms: ["facing a medical", "medical decision"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "future of our medical care", synonyms: ["future of our medical care", "our medical care decisions"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Assessment of the facts", synonyms: ["assess the facts", "evaluate the facts"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 391.85,
        end: 439.14,
        startIndex: 90,
        endIndex: 103,
        summary: "假设医生告诉你胆固醇偏高，要给你开他汀类药物。他汀是世界上最常用的处方药之一。但此刻你应该问一个大多数医生不愿谈、制药公司更不愿谈的统计数据。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "cholesterol is a little high", synonyms: ["cholesterol a little high", "slightly high cholesterol"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a statin", synonyms: ["a statin", "statin drug"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a statistic you should ask for", synonyms: ["a statistic to request", "ask for the statistic"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Most doctors don't like talking about", synonyms: ["doctors avoid discussing", "doctors don't like to discuss"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 439.28,
        end: 487.32,
        startIndex: 104,
        endIndex: 119,
        summary: "这个统计叫「需治疗人数」（NNT）：需要多少人服药、手术或其他医疗手段，才能有一个人获益。你或许以为这个数字该是 1，但医疗实践并非如此。对最常用的他汀来说，这个数字是 300。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "number needed to treat", synonyms: ["NNT", "number needed to treat"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "before one person is helped", synonyms: ["before one person benefits", "until one person is helped"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "The number should be one", synonyms: ["it should be one", "the number should be 1"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "300", synonyms: ["three hundred", "300 people"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 487.53,
        end: 556.28,
        startIndex: 120,
        endIndex: 139,
        summary: "300 人服药一整年，才能避免一次心脏病、中风等不良事件。而这款药有 5% 的患者会出现副作用：虚弱的肌肉关节痛、肠胃不适。300 人里 5% 就是 15 人——你被药物伤害的几率，是被它帮助的几率的 15 倍。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I ran through the numbers myself", synonyms: ["checked the numbers myself", "ran the numbers"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "one heart attack, stroke, or other adverse event", synonyms: ["one heart attack or stroke", "an adverse event"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "debilitating muscle and joint pain", synonyms: ["muscle and joint pain", "debilitating pain"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "15 times more likely to be harmed", synonyms: ["15 times more likely to be hurt", "fifteen times more likely"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 556.45,
        end: 645.92,
        startIndex: 140,
        endIndex: 163,
        summary: "他并不是说该不该吃他汀，而是说你应该和医生好好谈谈。医学伦理和知情同意原则都要求如此。你还应提前想生活质量这类问题：要短而无痛的人生，还是更长但临终可能痛苦的人生。即便临时改主意，至少你已练习过这种思考。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "have this conversation with your doctor", synonyms: ["talk with your doctor", "discuss with your doctor"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "informed consent", synonyms: ["informed consent", "consent"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "quality of life", synonyms: ["quality of life", "life quality"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "shorter life that's pain free", synonyms: ["pain-free shorter life", "shorter life without pain"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 646.23,
        end: 708.64,
        startIndex: 164,
        endIndex: 178,
        summary: "压力下大脑释放皮质醇，会关闭一大串系统，这是进化使然——面对捕食者时，消化、性欲、免疫都不重要，跑不快就成了狮子的午餐。但压力时刻被牺牲掉的还有理性逻辑思考，所以我们要训练自己提前思考，并承认人人都有缺陷。",
