        start: 714.54,
        end: 795.08,
        startIndex: 119,
        endIndex: 129,
        summary: "她的论点是：你攒下的自信越多，未来为自己打开的机会就越多；而自信只能靠一次次「飞跃」积累，哪怕结果可怕、未知、没有清晰的成功路径。别人在攒钱，她在攒那种「假装自信直到真的自信」永远换不来的真正自信。正因如此，她现在可以全力踩油门去追想要的生活——因为只要相信每次尝试都会积累自信，就不存在走错的一步。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the more confidence you bank", synonyms: ["the more confidence you build", "more confidence stored up"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "fake it till you make it", synonyms: ["pretend until it's real", "faking confidence"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "foot all the way on the gas", synonyms: ["pedal to the metal", "going full speed"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "You cannot make a wrong move", synonyms: ["no wrong moves", "you can't go wrong"]),
        ],
