        end: 880.0,
        startIndex: 130,
        endIndex: 145,
        summary: "她的布鲁克林品牌工作室给自己取名「最糟糕的设计」，收令人咋舌的价格，还要求客户全额预付；她坦然说别人不爱听的话，也推着客户去做让自己很不舒服的事。人们问她哪来的自信，她说不是因为自己是商业天才，也不是天生如此。当她要直面恐惧、把脸印上书封时，她已经为那一刻训练多年、准备好了——如今一搜她的名字，脸到处都是，而她已经不太在意别人的评判。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "branding studio in Brooklyn", synonyms: ["a Brooklyn branding agency", "Brooklyn design studio"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I charge audacious prices", synonyms: ["bold prices", "outrageous fees"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "taking leaps is the only way to bank true confidence", synonyms: ["leaps build true confidence", "only leaps bank real confidence"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "my face is everywhere", synonyms: ["my face shows up everywhere", "you see my face all over"]),
        ],
