        end: 73.92,
        startIndex: 0,
        endIndex: 7,
        summary: "讲者欢迎大家来到这场「18 分钟的比赛」，大家都属于梅赫伦队。一年前他决定当足球裁判，不是为了钱——一场才 20 欧元——而是为了保持身材，以及学会如何不把别人的话往心里去。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Welcome, welcome, welcome to this match", synonyms: ["welcome to this match", "welcome to the game"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "become a football referee", synonyms: ["become a soccer referee", "be a referee"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I only get paid 20 euros", synonyms: ["I only earn 20 euros", "I get 20 euros per match"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "how not to take things personally", synonyms: ["how not to take it personally", "how to stop taking things personally"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 73.92,
        end: 113.92,
        startIndex: 8,
        endIndex: 12,
        summary: "观众几乎从不喊积极的话，而是喊「你瞎了吗」。作为裁判，他是替罪羊，显然永远是他的错。而他想学会不把这一切往心里去，因为在这方面他真的非常挣扎。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the spectators hardly ever shout encouraging or positive things", synonyms: ["spectators rarely say positive things", "the crowd rarely shouts encouragement"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I'm the scapegoat", synonyms: ["I'm the scapegoat", "I take the blame"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "It's always my fault", synonyms: ["always my fault", "I'm always to blame"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I really struggle with this", synonyms: ["I struggle with this", "I find this really hard"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 114.19,
        end: 174.92,
        startIndex: 13,
        endIndex: 19,
        summary: "他举了几个「往心里去」的例子：开车慢被催、被人按喇叭闪大灯；约会最后一刻被取消；演讲时看到有人看手机。他明知不该这样，却还是会发生。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I feel hunted", synonyms: ["I feel chased", "I feel pursued"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "honking and flashing their headlights", synonyms: ["honking and flashing lights", "honking and flashing their lights"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I'm not important enough", synonyms: ["I don't matter enough", "I'm not important"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I take it personally", synonyms: ["I take it personally", "I take it to heart"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 174.92,
        end: 209.92,
        startIndex: 20,
        endIndex: 24,
        summary: "但今晚你们很安全，因为他现在非常有意识地知道这种情况可能发生，更重要的是，他有应对策略。所以今晚他想把这个策略分享给大家。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I have a strategy to deal with it", synonyms: ["I have a strategy to handle it", "I have a way to cope"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "share this strategy with you", synonyms: ["share this strategy", "share it with you"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I'm very conscious that this can happen", synonyms: ["I'm very aware this can happen", "I know it can happen"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 210.19,
        end: 257.92,
        startIndex: 25,
        endIndex: 31,
        summary: "他让大家想象：邀请朋友看电影被拒，却发现对方当晚和别人吃饭；辛苦做的项目只换来批评；倾诉时对方却走开去开电视。他问谁会把这样的事往心里去——很多人举了手。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you see a picture on social media", synonyms: ["you see a photo on social media", "you see it on social media"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the only thing you get is criticism", synonyms: ["all you get is criticism", "you only get criticized"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "walks away to switch on the TV", synonyms: ["walks away to turn on the TV", "walks off to switch on the TV"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "take one of these situations personally", synonyms: ["take these situations personally", "take it to heart"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 258.19,
        end: 318.92,
        startIndex: 32,
        endIndex: 38,
        summary: "为什么会往心里去？某人说或做了某事，我们感到受伤、被背叛，并相信是对方的错。说话的其实是我们的「自我」——自我希望被考虑到、不想被批评、只想被认可，想证明「我是对的」。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "we feel hurt, neglected or offended", synonyms: ["we feel hurt, ignored or offended", "we feel hurt and offended"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "It's the other person's fault", synonyms: ["it's the other person's fault", "they are to blame"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "It's our ego", synonyms: ["it's our ego", "it's the ego"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Our ego wants to be acknowledged", synonyms: ["our ego wants recognition", "the ego wants to be validated"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 319.19,
        end: 367.92,
        startIndex: 39,
        endIndex: 44,
        summary: "不把事情往心里去会轻松得多，因为那样就没人能掌控你，你就自由了，还能把精力投向美好的事。所以问题在于：你是想证明自己是对的，还是想快乐？",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "no one has power over you", synonyms: ["no one controls you", "nobody has power over you"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "You are free", synonyms: ["you're free", "you are free"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "do you want to be right", synonyms: ["do you want to be right", "do you want to be right or happy"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "How to become happy by not taking things personally", synonyms: ["how to be happy by not taking things personally", "how to stop taking things personally"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 368.19,
        end: 416.52,
        startIndex: 45,
        endIndex: 49,
        summary: "作为裁判，他带来了硬币——每一枚都有正面和反面，代表两种不再把事情往心里去的策略。他请观众选正反面，结果是正面，于是他开始讲第一个策略：「这不关我的事」。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "every coin has two sides", synonyms: ["every coin has two sides", "each coin has heads or tails"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "heads or tails", synonyms: ["heads or tails", "head or tail"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "two strategies", synonyms: ["two strategies", "two approaches"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "It's not about me", synonyms: ["it's not about me", "it isn't about me"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 417.19,
        end: 479.92,
        startIndex: 50,
        endIndex: 56,
        summary: "「这不关我的事」听起来很怪，因为往心里去时我们坚信就是关于自己。看到有人看手机，他本能想的是「我、我、我」。但如果从对方角度想，也许对方刚收到重要消息，或者想用手机记笔记。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "me, myself, and I", synonyms: ["me, myself and I", "it's all about me"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "look at it from the other person's perspective", synonyms: ["see it from their perspective", "see the other side"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "he has just received an important message", synonyms: ["he just got an important message", "he received an important message"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "take notes on his smartphone", synonyms: ["take notes on his phone", "note it down on his phone"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 479.92,
        end: 551.92,
        startIndex: 57,
        endIndex: 63,
        summary: "把焦点从「我」转到「我们」，理解对方的意图，就不会往心里去。就像哄儿子上床时他喊「我讨厌你」，你知道这跟你无关，他只是想多玩一会儿。所以第一个策略就是：去看对方的意图。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "shift my focus from me to we", synonyms: ["shift from me to we", "focus on we instead of me"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "make space for understanding instead of irritation", synonyms: ["make room for understanding, not irritation", "choose understanding over irritation"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I hate you", synonyms: ["I hate you", "I don't like you"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Look at the other person's intention", synonyms: ["see the other person's intention", "consider their intention"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 552.13,
        end: 626.92,
        startIndex: 64,
        endIndex: 70,
        summary: "大脑每天产生五万个念头，其中只有一万个是积极的，也就是说 80% 都是消极的。看到同事笑，你容易想「他们在笑我」。看到对方的积极意图需要大量自律和训练——这正是他当裁判的原因。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "how many thoughts our brain produces a day", synonyms: ["how many thoughts our brain produces daily", "how many thoughts we have a day"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "eighty percent of what we think", synonyms: ["80% of our thoughts", "eighty percent of our thoughts"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "they're gossiping about me", synonyms: ["they're talking about me", "they're gossiping about me"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a lot of discipline and training", synonyms: ["lots of discipline and training", "great discipline and training"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 626.92,
        end: 762.92,
        startIndex: 71,
        endIndex: 83,
        summary: "他每周训练大脑一个半小时（一场比赛）。赛前他做心理热身，在更衣室给自己打气：别往心里去，这不关我的事。这个策略有效，但不总是有效——当有人说「你是个失败者」，那确实戳中痛处，可能意味着「这确实关我的事」。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "train my brain an hour and a half a week", synonyms: ["train my brain 1.5 hours a week", "train my mind 90 minutes a week"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "give myself some pep talk", synonyms: ["give myself a pep talk", "pump myself up"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "You're a loser", synonyms: ["you're a loser", "you're a failure"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "it is about me", synonyms: ["it is about me", "it's about me"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 763.19,
        end: 912.02,
        startIndex: 84,
        endIndex: 97,
        summary: "这确实关他的事，因为它触及内心的不安全感——他从没踢过足球，怀疑自己。就像说「你是个橙子」没人会在意，除非戳中你相信的东西；说「你太自私」会痛，是因为里面有几分真实。被批评刺痛时，可能源于童年；这时该给自己同理心，并说出来。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I never played soccer", synonyms: ["I never played soccer", "I've never played football"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you are an orange", synonyms: ["you are an orange", "you're an orange"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you are so selfish", synonyms: ["you're so selfish", "you are selfish"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "give yourself some empathy", synonyms: ["give yourself empathy", "show yourself empathy"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 912.19,
        end: 1052.92,
        startIndex: 98,
        endIndex: 114,
        summary: "总结：第一，这不关我的事——看对方的意图；第二，这确实关我的事——给自己同理心并说出来。他希望大家在接下来几天真的去检验这两个策略，改善人际关系，共创更美好的世界（他甚至还能赚到 20 欧元）。最后：无论别人做什么说什么，你永远要保持自己的价值。",
        keyPoints: [
