    clips: [
      RetellClip(
        start: 0.02,
        end: 84.0,
        startIndex: 0,
        endIndex: 16,
        summary: "讲者用橡果作比喻：如果你想结出大橡果，就要像橡树那样思考，而不是像橡果。要像你想成为的那个人那样思考，就像基督徒问“如果是耶稣，他会怎么做”。橡果由果柄、果帽和种子三部分组成，分别代表与过去的连接、身边的引路人，以及你本人和你未来的潜能。于是他问：你体内藏着怎样的种子？",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "think like an oak, not like an acorn", synonyms: ["think like the oak", "think like the tree you'll become"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the person you intend to become", synonyms: ["the person you want to become", "your future self"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "what would Jesus do", synonyms: ["WWJD", "what would Jesus do in my place"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "what kind of seed is in you", synonyms: ["what seed lies within you", "your inner seed"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 84.02,
        end: 133.88,
        startIndex: 17,
        endIndex: 25,
        summary: "讲者相信，人生的责任之一就是弄清自己是谁、发现自己。首先要尊重自己的天性，意识到自己是传承链条中的一环；我们并非生物学上的偶然，而是被有意创造出来，为了无数个目的。他的人生哲学就是弄清这些事，并尽可能做好，为下一代留下正确的印记。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "find out who we are", synonyms: ["discover ourselves", "know who we are"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "part of a continuing chain", synonyms: ["a link in an ongoing chain", "part of a longer lineage"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "not biological coincidences", synonyms: ["not accidents of biology", "no biological accident"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "intentionally created for a myriad of purposes", synonyms: ["created on purpose", "made with intention"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 134.02,
        end: 186.99,
        startIndex: 26,
        endIndex: 38,
        summary: "第二，要了解自己的天性：采纳亚里士多德“认识你自己”的建议。但要了解多数人没有发现的自己——你以什么方式聪明、你在乎什么、你的“个人速度”、你携带的背景印记，以及你的行为风格和模式，从而不断更深入地认识自己。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "know thyself", synonyms: ["know yourself", "self-knowledge"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "know how you're smart", synonyms: ["know your kind of intelligence", "your form of smart"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "personal velocity", synonyms: ["your natural pace", "your intrinsic drive"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "background imprint", synonyms: ["the imprint you carry", "your inherited mark"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 187.02,
        end: 220.0,
        startIndex: 39,
        endIndex: 47,
        summary: "第三，要运用自己的天性。讲者说他从没指望成为不平凡的人，从小被教育要善良、平凡，以为会像父亲一样在电话公司工作，干到 65 岁退休，然后按家族平均寿命离世——这就是他原本的预期。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "anything but ordinary", synonyms: ["never more than ordinary", "just an ordinary person"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "work for the phone company", synonyms: ["a phone company job", "work at the phone company"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "retire at 65", synonyms: ["retire at sixty-five", "retire at 65 years old"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the statistical average age for my gene pool", synonyms: ["the average lifespan for my genetics", "the typical age for my family"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 220.02,
        end: 287.99,
        startIndex: 48,
        endIndex: 62,
        summary: "直到 1972 年的一天，隔壁房间的收音机里传来一个改变一切的声音。他当时在小石城房屋管理局当政府职员，月薪 525 美元，体重 200 磅，一天两包烟，没目标、没学历、没存款。说话的是被誉为“个人激励之父”的厄尔·南丁格尔：每天多花一小时研究所选领域，五年内就能成为全国专家。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a voice that changed everything", synonyms: ["a life-changing voice", "the voice that changed my life"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the Dean of Personal Motivation", synonyms: ["Earl Nightingale", "the father of personal motivation"]),
