        end: 389.0,
        startIndex: 77,
        endIndex: 86,
        summary: "五年里，他从没抱负的政府职员变成全职演讲者和培训师；两年后开始售卖厄尔·南丁格尔的培训材料，到 1984 年他的公司已在全球销售讲者的材料，第一批音频专辑头两年就卖出 350 万美元。他的公式有效，讲者多年里看到它在成百上千人身上应验。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "full time speaker and trainer", synonyms: ["full-time speaker and trainer", "professional speaker"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "selling my training materials worldwide", synonyms: ["selling my materials around the world", "global sales"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "three and a half million dollars", synonyms: ["\$3.5 million", "three and a half million"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "his formula works", synonyms: ["his method works", "the formula is effective"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 389.02,
        end: 420.0,
        startIndex: 87,
        endIndex: 94,
        summary: "想想看：如果你每天在看 TED 演讲之外，额外专注学习某一领域半小时，连续五年，你不仅会改变自己，还会改变周围的世界；而所有人一起，就会改变我们今天所知的整个世界。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "focus a half an hour a day", synonyms: ["half an hour daily of focus", "30 minutes a day"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "beyond the TED talk that you always watch", synonyms: ["in addition to watching TED talks", "on top of your TED viewing"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "transform the world around you", synonyms: ["change the world around you", "reshape your world"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 420.02,
        end: 436.99,
        startIndex: 95,
        endIndex: 101,
        summary: "你我都生来被赋予让世界更好的天赋。即便没有“改进”什么，此刻也能让世界更好：鼓励赞美别人、解决问题、捡起垃圾、修东西、带来新想法。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "born with the gift", synonyms: ["born with a gift", "naturally gifted"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "make this a better place", synonyms: ["improve the world", "make the world better"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "solve problems", synonyms: ["fix problems", "find solutions"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "pick up trash", synonyms: ["clean up litter", "collect garbage"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 437.02,
        end: 494.0,
        startIndex: 102,
        endIndex: 116,
        summary: "随着你成长，你会成为让生命通过你表达自己的更大源头。你被安排在这里是有原因的，它就藏在那颗橡果里。所以去滋养你的天性：先承认“我是有价值的”，了解自己，然后把自己投入世界，让涟漪波及全球。每天问自己：我想成为的那个人，会怎样做我即将要做的事？",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "nurture your nature", synonyms: ["cultivate your nature", "develop your nature"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I am valuable", synonyms: ["I have worth", "I matter"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "apply myself in the world", synonyms: ["put myself to work", "express myself in the world"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the ripple goes worldwide", synonyms: ["the ripple spreads globally", "ripples across the world"]),
        ],
