        end: 111.92,
        startIndex: 0,
        endIndex: 15,
        summary: "讲者开场自我介绍：她是 Mel Robbins，过去十七年只做一件事——帮人得到他们想要的一切，法庭上、卧室里、客厅里都干过。过去三年她主持一档全国联播的电台节目，每周五天直播，和全美各地「卡住了」的人聊天。她还做了一档同样疯狂的新节目《亲家》，把吵得不可开交的两家人搬进同一栋房子。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "help people get everything that they want", synonyms: ["help people get what they want", "help people achieve their goals", "get people what they want"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "syndicated radio show", synonyms: ["nationally syndicated radio show", "radio program", "radio show"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "feel stuck", synonyms: ["feel trapped", "feel unable to move forward", "feel paralyzed"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a third of Americans feel dissatisfied with their lives", synonyms: ["one third of Americans are unhappy", "a third of Americans are dissatisfied"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 112.24,
        end: 168.2,
        startIndex: 16,
        endIndex: 24,
        summary: "讲者让你们花一毫秒想清楚自己到底想要什么，而且要自私一点。别让它听起来好听——「保持健康」没法把你拽上跑步机，甩掉胸前的赘肉好去约会才是真正的动力。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "think about what you want", synonyms: ["think about what you desire", "figure out what you want"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "be selfish", synonyms: ["be self-centered", "put yourself first"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Healthy will not get your ass on a treadmill", synonyms: ["healthy won't get you on a treadmill", "being healthy won't motivate you to exercise"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "losing your man boobs", synonyms: ["getting rid of your man boobs", "losing chest fat"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 168.31,
        end: 218.16,
        startIndex: 25,
        endIndex: 31,
        summary: "别分析个没完，选一个就行——问题恰恰是你一直不肯选。得到想要的东西很简单，但注意不是容易。我们活在史上最不可思议的时代，无论是治糖尿病、照顾老人、开临终关怀中心还是去非洲建学校，都有办法。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "don't analyze it to death", synonyms: ["stop overanalyzing", "don't overthink it"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you won't pick", synonyms: ["you won't choose", "you can't decide"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "getting what you want is simple", synonyms: ["getting what you want is straightforward", "it's simple to get what you want"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "move to Africa and build a school", synonyms: ["go to Africa and build a school", "build a school in Africa"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 218.39,
        end: 279.16,
        startIndex: 32,
        endIndex: 40,
        summary: "你现在走进书店就能买到十本专家写的书，上网能搜到上千篇记录别人一步步转变的博客，照着别人的脚步走就行。既然信息、人脉、工具都齐了，你为什么还是没得到想要的？全归结到一个词。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "walk into a bookstore", synonyms: ["go to a bookstore", "enter a bookstore"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "walk in their footsteps", synonyms: ["follow their footsteps", "follow their example"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "someone else is already doing it", synonyms: ["someone else has done it", "someone is already doing it"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "all the information that you need", synonyms: ["all the info you need", "everything you need to know"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 279.5,
        end: 337.56,
        startIndex: 41,
        endIndex: 48,
        summary: "这个词就是「还行」。别人问「最近怎么样」，你说「还行吧」——可你拖着四十斤赘肉、跟配偶像室友一样、四个月没有性生活，你还「还行」？说「还行」其实很高明，因为既然还行，你就什么都不用改。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the word fine", synonyms: ["the word fine", "the word okay"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "dragging around those extra 40 pounds", synonyms: ["carrying around 40 extra pounds", "40 pounds overweight"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Feeling like roommates with your spouse", synonyms: ["feeling like a roommate to your spouse", "distant from your partner"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you don't have to do anything about it", synonyms: ["no need to change", "nothing needs to change"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 337.91,
        end: 419.88,
        startIndex: 49,
        endIndex: 61,
        summary: "「还行」是个软弱无力的词：糟糕就说糟糕，很棒就说很棒，说实话。更大的问题是，你是对自己说「还行」——你早已说服自己，没有那个东西也「还行」，那正是你人生中已经放弃的领域。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a flimsy and feeble word", synonyms: ["a weak and flimsy word", "a feeble word"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "If you're crappy, say you're crappy", synonyms: ["if you feel bad, say so", "be honest about feeling bad"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you say it to yourself", synonyms: ["you tell yourself", "you say it to yourself"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "The areas in your life where you've given up", synonyms: ["the places you've given up", "where you've given up"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 420.23,
        end: 493.23,
        startIndex: 62,
        endIndex: 70,
        summary: "科学家算过你出生的概率，把战争、自然灾害、恐龙等所有因素都考虑进去，结果是四百万亿分之一。讲者现场拿道格举例——你不是「还行」，你简直不可思议。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "calculated the odds of you", synonyms: ["computed the odds of you being born", "figured out the odds of you"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "crunched the numbers", synonyms: ["crunched the numbers", "ran the numbers"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "wars and the natural disasters and the dinosaurs", synonyms: ["wars, disasters and dinosaurs", "all of history's events"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "400 trillion", synonyms: ["one in 400 trillion", "1 in 400 trillion"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 493.54,
        end: 559.64,
        startIndex: 71,
        endIndex: 80,
        summary: "你整天都有能改变人生的念头，却拿它们什么都没做。讲者喜欢用「内心的贪睡键」来比喻：这些念头像乒乓球一样不断冒出来，而每次你有了念头，都「砰」地把它按掉。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "life changing ideas", synonyms: ["life-changing ideas", "ideas that could change your life"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the inner snooze button", synonyms: ["inner snooze button", "the snooze button inside you"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "bubble up", synonyms: ["pop up", "surface"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you've got an idea what you should", synonyms: ["you get an idea of what to do", "an idea of what you should do"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 559.96,
        end: 668.03,
        startIndex: 81,
        endIndex: 95,
        summary: "今天早上你做的第一个决定是「再睡一会儿」。想改变人生的任何领域，有个事实你必须认清：你永远不会「想做」。没人会来救你，动力不会自己出现——科学家叫它「活化能」。试试明天把闹钟调早三十分钟，一响就掀被子站起来，不按贪睡。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "the first decision you made this morning", synonyms: ["your first decision this morning", "this morning's first decision"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "you're never going to feel like it", synonyms: ["you'll never feel like it", "you won't ever feel like doing it"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "activation energy", synonyms: ["activation energy", "the energy to get started"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "tomorrow morning set your alarm", synonyms: ["set your alarm tomorrow morning", "set your alarm for tomorrow"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 668.34,
        end: 786.68,
        startIndex: 96,
        endIndex: 112,
        summary: "你会亲身面对改变行为所需的实在力量——需要减肥的人从不会想吃水煮鸡配豌豆。成年意味着「管好自己」成了你的工作：逼自己去做不想做的事。就算擅长了也会停滞、无聊，所以得到想要的很简单，但不容易，你得逼自己。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "physical force that's required", synonyms: ["physical force required", "the physical effort needed"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "parent yourself", synonyms: ["parent yourself", "be your own parent"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "make yourself do the crap you don't want", synonyms: ["force yourself to do what you don't want", "do the stuff you don't want to do"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "Get what you want, but it's not easy", synonyms: ["getting what you want is simple but not easy", "it's simple but not easy"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 787.0,
        end: 872.92,
        startIndex: 113,
        endIndex: 127,
        summary: "大脑只有两个挡位：自动驾驶和紧急刹车。开车到公司却不记得怎么开来的，就是自动驾驶。任何偏离日常的事都会触发紧急刹车——就像看到别人把早餐碗留给你，你第一百次想发火，最后却还是自动驾驶地自己洗了、然后生闷气。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "autopilot", synonyms: ["on autopilot", "automatic mode"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "emergency brake", synonyms: ["emergency brake", "the brakes"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I don't remember driving here", synonyms: ["I don't remember the drive", "can't recall driving here"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "I'll just load it and be pissed", synonyms: ["I'll just wash them and be angry", "just do it and be annoyed"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 873.12,
        end: 958.24,
        startIndex: 128,
        endIndex: 146,
        summary: "任何打破日常的事都需要「逼」。我们花一辈子把生活塞进稳定的日常，然后又对它感到无聊——难怪你无聊到发疯，是那一成不变在耗死你。讲者提到马斯洛的需求层次：身体有基本需求，也会发出信号。",
        keyPoints: [
          KeyPoint(phrase: "a break from your routine", synonyms: ["a break from routine", "something outside your routine"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "bored out of your mind", synonyms: ["bored to death", "extremely bored"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "It's the routine that's killing you", synonyms: ["the routine is killing you", "your routine is what kills you"]),
          KeyPoint(phrase: "hierarchy of needs", synonyms: ["Maslow's hierarchy of needs", "pyramid of needs"]),
        ],
      ),
      RetellClip(
        start: 958.24,
        end: 1112.74,
        startIndex: 147,
        endIndex: 174,
        summary: "卡住或不满足是个信号：你最基本的「探索」需求没被满足。身体的一切都在生长，灵魂也需要探索。唯一的办法是逼自己待在不舒服里、走出头脑——待在脑子里就等于身处敌后。别管感受，走出去，奇迹在外面（讲者以与瑞秋相遇为例）。",
        keyPoints: [
